@alertId = 0196f840-000b-7000-8000-00000000040b

### W4-S1: List Financial Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W4-S1: Create Tax-Deductible Charitable Fund Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community Scholarship Fund",
  "publicName": "Community Scholarship Fund",
  "code": "SCHOLARSHIP-FUND",
  "accountKind": "CharitableFund",
  "isTaxDeductible": true,
  "defaultCurrencyCode": "USD",
  "glCode": "4100-10",
  "costCenterCode": "CC-EDU"
}

### W4-S1: Get Financial Account By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W4-S1: Update Financial Account
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community Scholarship Endowment",
  "publicName": "Scholarship Endowment",
  "code": "SCHOLARSHIP-FUND",
  "accountKind": "CharitableFund",
  "isTaxDeductible": true,
  "defaultCurrencyCode": "USD"
}

