}

### W4-S1: List Organizations & Sponsors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W4-S1: Get Organization By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/organizations/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W4-S1: Update Organization
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/organizations/{{personId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

