### W4-S3: Record Multi-Split Financial Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorizedPersonId": "{{personId}}",
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "sourceType": "StaffEntry",
  "tenderType": "CreditCard",
  "batchId": "{{batchId}}",
  "financialGatewayId": "{{gatewayId}}",
  "savedPaymentMethodId": "{{savedMethodId}}",
  "splits": [
    {
      "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
      "amount": 180.00,
      "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
      "summary": "Dues payment"
    }
  ]
}

