### W4-S5: List Statement & Tax Receipt Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/statements/templates?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W4-S5: Create Combined Separated Statement Template
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/statements/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Annual Combined Separated Receipt & Statement",
  "statementKind": "CombinedSeparatedStatement",
  "organizationDisplayName": "Civic Horizon Foundation",
  "organizationTaxId": "84-7654321",
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "headerMergeTemplate": "<p>Prepared for {{ RecipientName }} ({{ PeriodStart }} to {{ PeriodEnd }}).</p>",
  "footerMergeTemplate": "<p>Tax-deductible total: {{ TaxDeductibleTotal }} {{ CurrencyCode }}. Non-deductible total: {{ NonDeductiblePaidTotal }} {{ CurrencyCode }}.</p>",
  "includePledgeSummary": true,
  "includeOpenInvoices": true,
  "minimumTotalThreshold": 10.00,
  "isDefault": true,
  "isActive": true
}

